{"noun":[{"images":{"small":"","grid":"","large":"","medium":""},"name":"平安","summary":"","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/ac/22/16597_prsn_koQ7d.jpg?r=1422334055","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/ac/22/16597_prsn_koQ7d.jpg?r=1422334055","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/ac/22/16597_prsn_koQ7d.jpg?r=1422334055","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/ac/22/16597_prsn_koQ7d.jpg?r=1422334055"},"name":"刘诗诗","short_summary":"刘诗诗，本名刘诗施，回族人，中国大陆知名女演员，毕业于北京舞蹈学院芭蕾舞系02级本科班。2004年因出演电视剧《月影风荷》而步入演艺圈。2007年正式签约经纪公司，先后出演《射雕英雄传》、《仙剑奇侠传三》、《天涯织女》、《怪侠一枝梅》等多部电视剧。2011年因在清朝穿越宫廷剧《步步惊心》中饰演女主人公马尔泰·若曦而一举成名，成为炙手可热的新生代女星，并开始进军大银幕，拍摄了《不二神探》、《回到爱开始的地方》、《绣春刀》、《深夜前的五分钟》等电影作品。2014年因出演《风中奇缘》中的狼女莘月又积累了超高的人气，跻身中国大陆新“四小花旦”之一。\r\n\r\n2015年1月20日，吴奇隆在微博宣布与刘诗诗结婚。吴奇隆发微博称“珍惜幸福”，并附上结婚证与钻戒的照片。刘诗诗随后转发该微博，称“我们很幸福”。","career":["actor"],"id":16597,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":193216},{"images":{"small":"","grid":"","large":"","medium":""},"name":"霜眉","summary":"","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/5c/88/61946_prsn_SEVmx.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/5c/88/61946_prsn_SEVmx.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/5c/88/61946_prsn_SEVmx.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/5c/88/61946_prsn_SEVmx.jpg"},"name":"张思王之","short_summary":"中国配音演员，北京演艺专修学院播音与主持艺术系14级学生。\r\n\r\n2016年5月曾参加录制河南卫视节目《寻找新主播》，2017年加入边江工作室。","career":["seiyu"],"id":61946,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":193217},{"images":{"small":"","grid":"","large":"","medium":""},"name":"阿拜","summary":"","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/72/7c/81705_prsn_C7VQV.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/72/7c/81705_prsn_C7VQV.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/72/7c/81705_prsn_C7VQV.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/72/7c/81705_prsn_C7VQV.jpg"},"name":"李嘉祥","short_summary":"","career":["seiyu"],"id":81705,"type":1,"locked":false}],"ty